{"id":"c53f0a53ee4a6c70","group":"67","path":"67/67-lem-general-orey-hajek.md","title":"Finite Consistency through a Reflexive Arithmetic Interpretation","display":"lem-general-orey-hajek — Finite Consistency through a Reflexive Arithmetic Interpretation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-lem-general-orey-hajek","aliases":["67-lem-general-orey-hajek"],"display":"lem-general-orey-hajek — Finite Consistency through a Reflexive Arithmetic Interpretation","depends_on":["[[67-df-reflexive-interpretation]]","[[67-df-general-consistency]]","[[67-thm-reflexive-pullback-equivalence]]","[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-lem-general-source-orey-hajek]]","[[67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_scope":"第 8 章 §3，Lemma 4，印刷页 123；PDF 第 134 页","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"图像与短证明已核对；一般源语言版本算术化完备性保留未完证明义务","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-lem-general-orey-hajek"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-lem-general-orey-hajek</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-general-orey-hajek — Finite Consistency through a Reflexive Arithmetic Interpretation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb51163c70a06b3c\" href=\"?note=fb51163c70a06b3c\" title=\"67-df-reflexive-interpretation\">67-df-reflexive-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d4e4a9a8f1949a67\" href=\"?note=d4e4a9a8f1949a67\" title=\"67-thm-reflexive-pullback-equivalence\">67-thm-reflexive-pullback-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4787e57ce7daa89b\" href=\"?note=4787e57ce7daa89b\" title=\"67-lem-general-source-orey-hajek\">67-lem-general-source-orey-hajek</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"433a5a5e16d90414\" href=\"?note=433a5a5e16d90414\" title=\"67-df-general-relative-interpretation\">67-df-general-relative-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 8 章 §3，Lemma 4，印刷页 123；PDF 第 134 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"图像与短证明已核对；一般源语言版本算术化完备性保留未完证明义务"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是有限有效一阶语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K\\)</span> 是一致 PR 公理呈示，采用本册固定强编号和证明算术化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>一般解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd_{L,K}\">\\(\\unlhd_{L,K}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"433a5a5e16d90414\" href=\"?note=433a5a5e16d90414\" title=\"67-df-general-relative-interpretation\">67-df-general-relative-interpretation</a>；一般语言的算术一致性句和代码有界公理片段取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a>。下标标出源、目标语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 的量化与公式编码均在元层。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为另一个有限有效一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 是一致 PR 公理呈示，采用固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_L\">\\(g_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 无需包含算术语言或解释 PA。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RInt}_K(\\mathrm{PA},T,t)\">\\(\\mathrm{RInt}_K(\\mathrm{PA},T,t)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^L_{S\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^L_{S\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的应用有类型。所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的量词在外部自然数上，未把逐个可证升级为单一全称句可证。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>语法和证明参数固定为本册 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_K=c_K\">\\(g_K=c_K\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{K,T},D,\\gamma\">\\(e_{K,T},D,\\gamma\\)</span>；所有有限片段使用同一演算和该文件声明的程序图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a> 的同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_K\">\\(\\pi_K\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)\">\\(\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)\\)</span>；本条所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-公理集及其有限片段的一致性句均由该系统绑定，因而包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdGPrf}\">\\(\\mathrm{StdGPrf}\\)</span> 的 PA 内桥接条件。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>源语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 同样固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_L\">\\(\\pi_L\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_L(\\pi_L)\">\\(\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_L(\\pi_L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k\">\\(S\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k\\)</span> 使用该系统，而不是目标语言的程序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=K\">\\(L=K\\)</span>，则固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_L=\\pi_K\">\\(\\pi_L=\\pi_K\\)</span>，不为同一语言引入两套不同的片段一致性表示。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\unlhd_{L,K}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(T\\vdash t(\\mathrm{Con}^L_{S\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\unlhd_{L,K}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(T\\vdash t(\\mathrm{Con}^L_{S\\upharpoonright_{g_L}k})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>由反身 pullback 等价，左侧等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\unlhd\\mathrm{PB}(t,T)\">\\(S\\unlhd\\mathrm{PB}(t,T)\\)</span>。应用第6章有限一致性判据的一般源语言版本，得到每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的一致性在 pullback 中可证，再由 Lemma1 的可推导性对应得到右侧。</p>\n<p>已核对 PDF134 的假设是固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathrm{PA}\\unlhd^r T\">\\(t:\\mathrm{PA}\\unlhd^r T\\)</span>，不是只要目标中存在某种算术解释；右侧使用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>。上游的一般源语言判据现由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"4787e57ce7daa89b\" href=\"?note=4787e57ce7daa89b\" title=\"67-lem-general-source-orey-hajek\">67-lem-general-source-orey-hajek</a> 显式给出；其依赖不包含本引理或反身 pullback 等价定理。原书证明及算术化完备性细节未作本轮机器核验，故不登记完整已核验证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 PDF；第 8 章 §3，Lemma 4，印刷页 123；PDF 第 134 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：图像与短证明已核对；一般源语言版本算术化完备性保留未完证明义务。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-reflexive-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"fb51163c70a06b3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-reflexive-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-general-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-general-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-reflexive-pullback-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"d4e4a9a8f1949a67","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-reflexive-pullback-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","loc